The files in this directory (trials.json, regimens.json, tox.json, labels.json,
rechallenge.json) are curated extracts of published clinical-trial results and
public FDA drug labels, compiled by Chin-Jui Wu (吳晉睿), 2026.

They are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt them for any purpose, including commercially, provided
you give appropriate credit, link to the license, and indicate if changes were
made. The underlying trial publications and labels remain the property of their
respective publishers and are cited by PMID and DailyMed setid in each file.

These files are not clinical advice.
